!!!lujvo
*raltca [[capital] (Comment from totus: This could  mean 'financial/economical capital' such as New York, or 'religious capital' such as Mecca.  For the seat of goverment use 'trutca').
*fasygu'e [[France]
*mergu'e [[USA]

||__Lojban__|__English__
do xabju ma poi gugde | In what country do you live?
mi xabju le fasygu'e | I live in France.
mi jbena fo le fasygu'e | I [[was] born in France.||